Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A ship at anchor has no emergency room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:23.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The hospital they needed was on the main island,
