Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Coast Guard decided that a helicopter was the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}best way to get the four of them there.
