Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:10.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Those numbers are the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Every mile out is a mile back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:15.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Every minute spent hovering over a ship is fuel the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:16.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}crew will need to get home.
