Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On Halloween, off San Francisco, the job went to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}another Coast Guard helicopter, an MH-65 Dolphin.
