Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:05.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Often, that is the pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}One aircraft to search, guide and watch. One to hoist.
